# Build context trimming. Keep this list tight: the context is uploaded to the
# daemon on every build, and .venv + .git + the raw CSVs are ~1.1GB of it.
#
# NOTE: `.env` is deliberately NOT excluded. This image is built to carry the
# copilot API key inside it, by explicit request. See the header of Dockerfile.

.venv/
.git/
.gitignore
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.playwright/
.DS_Store
._*

# The raw CSVs are reproduced byte-for-byte from data/data.tgz inside the
# build, so shipping 409MB of them in the context is pure waste.
data/transactional_banking.csv
data/cross_border_payments.csv
data/trade_finance.csv

# Built inside the image by stages 1-4, not copied in.
data/processed/

# ...except the stored copilot answers. These are stage 5 output and rebuilding
# them needs live, rate-limited API calls, so the committed set is copied in.
# They are the fallback when the key is missing, expired or rate-limited.
!data/processed/copilot_demos.json

# Operational, not source.
copilot_audit.jsonl
